        "en": "It was already afternoon when I found it, well past the collection time. The umbrella lay quietly atop a pile of non-burnable trash, looking somewhat out of place. The scene brings to mind a certain image: after the truck had gone, a small figure wearing an eyepatch—like a thief—sneaked over and quietly dropped the umbrella there. Having missed the official window, it was left behind as a remnant of this comical 'secret mission'."
